WEBVTT

00:20:58.387 --> 00:21:00.649
who has what balance sheet,

00:21:00.673 --> 00:21:03.379
and how do we deal
with money and credit --

00:21:03.403 --> 00:21:06.850
those things, which people
often lose sight of,

00:21:06.874 --> 00:21:09.977
because they happen only once
in one's lifetime.

00:21:10.001 --> 00:21:15.449
This period, you have to go back
to the 1930s as the last period.

00:21:15.473 --> 00:21:18.458
Those fundamentals of what a bank is,

00:21:18.482 --> 00:21:21.448
and the associated process,

00:21:21.472 --> 00:21:23.761
have existed all through time.

00:21:24.411 --> 00:21:29.126
Then it's, like, technology changes.

00:21:29.442 --> 00:21:31.307
Technology evolves.